                <pb facs="0608" n="524" sameAs="frus:frus1886/pg524"/>

                <p>Personally appeared before me Murdock Kemp, at Provincetown, State of
                    Massachusetts, United States of America, this 27th day of September, 1886, who
                    subscribed and made oath to the foregoing.</p>
                <closer>[<hi rendition="#small-caps">seal</hi>.] <signed>JAMES GIFFORD,<lb/><hi
